  "enhancements": {
    "working_disk_size": 1536,
    "limb_model": "Estimated median quiet-photosphere intensity in 219 concentric annuli from the disk centre to the limb and interpolated them radially. Boosted the resulting neutral profile by 10.5% and retained 56% of the observed small-amplitude residual, bounded at ±5 source levels to avoid duplicate spots.",
    "observed_spots": "Used local fractional darkness relative to measured quiet-photosphere intensity. Gaussian-smoothed by 0.85 working px, accepted connected features with >17% contrast, at least 18 px area, and a dark core >36.5%. Rejected features exterior to 0.975 disk radii. Grouped nearby detections and retained the five observed group areas of 25+ working pixels.",
    "magnification": "Magnified about the measured centre of each group without rotation or reflection. The two larger groups were enlarged by 1.86×; smaller regions were enlarged by 2.10× (1.974× for the smallest). In each region the actual darkness field was blended with its 5-working-pixel-radius greyscale maximum filter (59% filtered/41% raw). Used a continuous nonlinear transfer and an approximate 13/255 charcoal floor. Retained observed core/penumbra variation. Original group centres and relative orientation are retained; within-group distances and sizes are intentionally cartographically enlarged.",
    "encoding": "384×384 RGBA, lossless WebP. Neutral R=G=B. All non-axisymmetric surface structures originate with the same single HMI measurement."
  },
